    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NECROMANCER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight an onslaught of terrifying enemies in this 90s FPS inspired arena shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is for fans of roguelikes, and quakelike movement shooters, and it even has a touch of action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather many different weapons with distinct purposes to annihilate your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the eldritch hellscape of the Necromancer's trial, and survive as long as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FLY LIKE A BOLT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391340/extras/3b653062077cd8d64b2c68a4c8dbce38.poster.avif?t=1747529762\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391340/extras/3b653062077cd8d64b2c68a4c8dbce38.webm?t=1747529762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391340/extras/3b653062077cd8d64b2c68a4c8dbce38.mp4?t=1747529762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUILD YOUR ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391340/extras/7cac7dc158c475fcbddd41a7b18e7f84.poster.avif?t=1747529762\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391340/extras/7cac7dc158c475fcbddd41a7b18e7f84.webm?t=1747529762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391340/extras/7cac7dc158c475fcbddd41a7b18e7f84.mp4?t=1747529762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div